# Rust / Tauri
src-tauri/target/
# The bundler's icon directory is *derived* from `macast/assets/` by
# `src-tauri/build.rs` on every build. Committing a second copy of the artwork
# would create two sources of truth for one logo — the same drift §4.3 of
# AGENTS.md documents for dependency lists.
src-tauri/icons/
# tauri-build writes these JSON schemas on every build, and which ones appear
# depends on the host (`macOS-schema.json` on a Mac, `linux-schema.json` on the
# Linux job). Ignored rather than committed so a checkout doesn't carry a
# stale, platform-shaped copy of them. `src-tauri/gen/` as a whole stays
# trackable because mobile targets commit real files under it.
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

# IPython
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

